            </note>
            <note corresp="#d774-f2" n="17" xml:id="d774-f2-content">
                <p>Tadeusz Romer; note of July 3 not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d774-f3" n="18" xml:id="d774-f3-content">
                <p>For previous correspondence, see <ref target="frus1942v01#pg_45">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1942, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 45</ref> ff.; for text of
                    Declaration, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>,
                    December 19, 1942, p. 1009.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
